				<r3d:description language="eng">Paris Astronomical Data Centre aims at providing VO access to its data collections, at participating to international standards developments, at implementing VO compliant simulation codes, data visualization and analysis software.
This centre hosts high level permanent activities for tools and data distribution under the format of reference services. These sustainable services are recognized at the national level as CNRS labeled services.
The various activities are organised as portals whose functions are to provide visibility and information on the projects and to encourage collaboration.</r3d:description>
